      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Traffic jam again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：是啊！现在几点了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：是啊！現在幾點了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shì a xiàn zài jǐ diǎn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Right! What time is it now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：5点半。",
      "traditional": "本：5點半。",
      "pinyin": "běn 1 diǎn bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Half past 5."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：从这儿到机场不远了。没关系，我们能赶上飞机。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：從這兒到機場不遠了。沒關係，我們能趕上飛機。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì cóng zhè‘r dào jī chǎng bù yuǎn le méi guān xi wǒ men néng gǎn shàng fēi jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The airport is not far from here. No worries, we'll make it in time for the flight."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：还好我们出来得早。",
      "traditional": "本：還好我們出來得早。",
      "pinyin": "běn hái hǎo wǒ men chū lái de zǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Good thing we left early."
    }
  ],
